8
00:00:20,780 --> 00:00:24,180
by a process called tokenization into tokens.

9
00:00:24,580 --> 00:00:26,520
Now, a token doesn't always have to be a word.

10
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:30,120
You can have smaller amounts such as a character

11
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:33,060
or two letters, but the idea is that chat GPT

12
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:37,220
takes a series of words and converts that into tokens.

13
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:39,820
Each model has a different number of input tokens

14
00:00:39,820 --> 00:00:42,360
